re relying on material for a consequential decision. You may link to this site for informational purposes without implying endorsement.</p><h2>Third-party names</h2><p>Framework, product, and company names are used only to identify technologies, environments, and practices that a client may ask us to assess, integrate, or operate. Their appearance does not imply affiliation, sponsorship, endorsement, certification, authorization, or a reseller or training relationship unless expressly documented. All trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:info@globalenterprise.com">info@globalenterprise.com</a>.</p></div></div></section></Base>
